The '''Broken Cage''' is a sub-location of the {{zone|Wyld Woods}} in the [[Rift Dimension]]. It is based on an area of the {{zone|Wilderness}}.

== Purpose ==
=== Wither Skulls ===
There are {{Green|5}} {{Item|Wither Skull|link=}}s scattered across the floor of the '''Broken Cage''', surrounding {{NPCSprite|Porhtal}}. Each of them can be clicked to reveal an eerie line of dialogue, and one of them cause an opening in a nearby tree, revealing an [[#Enigma Souls|Enigma Soul]] when the player interacts with it.

=== Porhtal ===
{{Main|Porhtal}}
Located in the center of the '''Broken Cage''' is {{NPCSprite|Porhtal}}, an [[NPC]] that owns seven rogue eyes that can be found across the [[Rift Dimension]]. Each of them can be calmed to gain a permanent {{Stat|rt}} bonus. The player can teleport from {{NPCSprite|Porhtal}} or any of their calmed eyes to another to easily travel across areas at the cost of a large chunk of {{Stat|rt}}. Note that this cost usually amounts to {{Green|10%}} less than traveling there yourself.

